WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.360
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain an American mystery adventure television&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:15.920
series called “The Mysterious Benedict&nbsp;
Society”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:23.840
The premise of the movie is set far in the&nbsp;
future. Our world is secretly being attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:30.080
by a mysterious force that is making people&nbsp;
more anxious everyday. Because of the anxiety,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:36.720
the illusion of international panic known as "The&nbsp;
Emergency" is created. It has induced citizens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:41.600
with a fear of something bad happening&nbsp;
which in turn, messes with the economy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:47.200
and other factors plaguing the world.
Reynie is an orphan who loves to read and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:52.880
enjoys his own company. He wants to make friends&nbsp;
but the children in the orphanage make fun of him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.840
for being intelligent. He often feels out of&nbsp;
place, mostly because the others aren’t half&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:04.160
as smart as him. His only mentor is his Tamil&nbsp;
language teacher, Ms. Perumal. One day, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.440
shows him an advertisement about a test, in which&nbsp;
the winners are awarded a scholarship to attend a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:15.120
prestigious school called the Boatwright Academy.&nbsp;
Reynie has always wanted to go to Boatwright&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:20.480
but he doubts his abilities. Ms. Peruman&nbsp;
assures him that he will be the most deserving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.440
one out of all the attendees of the test. 
The next morning, she comes to pick him up. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:30.960
they drive to the examination hall and separate&nbsp;
after a hug. Many children alongside him have come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:37.120
to take the test. Their examiner is named Number&nbsp;
Two, a quirky but strict woman who briefs them on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:42.560
what they can and cannot do. Reynie looks at the&nbsp;
first question which asks him, if he has a chance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:48.560
to save only one between an elephant and a llama&nbsp;
falling from a height, who would he save. Reynie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.280
answers that he would save the elephant in hopes&nbsp;
that it could break the llama’s fall and both of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:58.320
them would survive. After answering several such&nbsp;
questions with answers related to compassion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.920
he reaches the last one that asks him if he&nbsp;
is brave. Reynie takes time to think about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.200
it and answers that he would like to think so.&nbsp;
Number two asks them to drop their pencils. 
&nbsp;

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.080
She grades the papers as the students&nbsp;
wait patiently. After getting done, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:18.560
informs them that the students who pass this&nbsp;
test will be admitted to the second phase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:23.680
of the exam. They should report to a&nbsp;
building in the next block at exactly 1 pm.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:29.280
She also emphasizes that they are only allowed to&nbsp;
bring a single pencil and eraser to the test. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.760
Reynie asks her if they will be provided with&nbsp;
sharpeners in case the lead breaks, she answers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:38.400
that they will have everything necessary for the&nbsp;
test. Then, she reads the list of students who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:44.320
passed that has only Reynie’s name on it. Everyone&nbsp;
else disappointedly leaves the premises while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:49.600
Reynie goes to the next examination hall. 
While walking inside, a girl before him named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:54.720
Rhonda accidentally drops her pencil into a&nbsp;
sewer drain. Ronda’s friend abandons her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.400
walks inside but, Reynie offers to help her. They&nbsp;
only have a few minutes before the exam starts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.360
so he breaks his pencil into two and hands&nbsp;
one to her, confident that a sharpener will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:10.800
be provided inside. She expresses gratitude and&nbsp;
offers to show him the answers during the test&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:16.320
but Reynie declines the offer. In the examination&nbsp;
hall, Number two explains to them that anyone who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:22.720
speaks during the test will be dismissed. She also&nbsp;
adds that the test will be long and difficult. A&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:28.640
girl groans at the comment and is disqualified for&nbsp;
making noise. Reynie raises his hand and gestures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:33.600
that he needs to sharpen his pencil. Number&nbsp;
two understands and allows him to do so. 
&nbsp;

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:39.840
The test finally starts and only a few seconds in,&nbsp;
a boy runs away shouting that he cannot do this.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:43.680
Reynie focuses on the questions which&nbsp;
are too difficult for him to understand.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:50.080
Most of them are advanced-level questions about&nbsp;
world history and geography. Still, Rhonda,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.280
who is seated right before Reynie, gets done in&nbsp;
only half an hour. Before submitting the answers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:00.640
she secretly drops a small piece of paper for&nbsp;
Reynie. He notices the paper has all the answers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.520
on it. Although Reynie is struggling with the&nbsp;
questions, he doesn’t pick it up. The atmosphere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:10.880
is intense as some students almost cry because&nbsp;
of the difficult questions. Reynie knows none&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:15.520
of the answers but on reading the questions&nbsp;
carefully, he realizes that the answer to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:22.080
first question is hidden in the last question.&nbsp;
That way, all the answers are in the questions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:28.000
themselves. After finding that out, he easily&nbsp;
writes them down and does great on the test. 
&nbsp;

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.440
A while later, the result is announced and again,&nbsp;
only Reynie passes. It is surprising to him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:38.960
because Rhonda has cheated. She wishes him luck&nbsp;
and leaves him to wait for further instruction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:45.840
Then, an A grade student named Sticky Washington&nbsp;
enters the room. Sticky has an eidetic memory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:50.800
meaning he can remember everything he sets his&nbsp;
eyes on. He was also the only one who passed the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:55.840
test in his batch which he thinks is weird&nbsp;
because someone else had cheated. It turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:01.200
out that they had the same experience before the&nbsp;
test and met the same girl who dropped her pencil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:06.960
in the sewage. They figure out the actual aim of&nbsp;
the trick was to test their loyalty and kindness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:11.760
Therefore, they passed and the other students&nbsp;
who only focused on the questions, didn’t. 
&nbsp;

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:17.120
Suddenly, a girl comes running to the room and&nbsp;
introduces herself as Kate. She is an athletic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:22.320
and adventurous girl who never goes anywhere&nbsp;
without her red bucket of tools. Kate claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:27.520
that she didn’t actually pass the test because&nbsp;
the questions were too difficult. Infact, she was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:33.280
selected because she helped Number two chase away&nbsp;
all the angry parents by creating a distraction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:39.200
Then, Krista and Dewey join the group. They have&nbsp;
also passed the exam and are pretty confident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.120
that they will make it to the Boatwright&nbsp;
Academy. Krista is a know-it-all who thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:48.480
that everyone is inferior to her. After the team&nbsp;
has assembled, they are introduced to Milligan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:53.680
the overseer of the next test. He instructs&nbsp;
them to enter a room one after another,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:58.240
and asks Krista to go first. 
She walks into the room and notices the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:03.520
chessboard patterned floor. A note on the floor&nbsp;
asks her to cross the room without stepping on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:08.480
the black or white squares. She bluntly&nbsp;
says no, refusing to do the task because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:13.520
she thinks it is a trick question. Milligan&nbsp;
disqualifies her and asks her to go home. 
&nbsp;

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.720
Next, Dewey enters the room and uses his&nbsp;
athletic abilities to jump to the yellow squares.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:23.920
He sticks to the wall, and leaps to the other&nbsp;
end of the room easily. After he passes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:28.800
Kate enters with her red buckets of tools.&nbsp;
She uses a rope from her bucket and ties it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:34.640
tightly to make a pathway. Kate used to work in&nbsp;
a circus for a long time and can easily walk on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:40.400
ropes. She uses her skills to reach the other end&nbsp;
and complete the task. When it is Sticky’s turn,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.360
he reads the question carefully and figures&nbsp;
out that it specifically asks them to not step&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:51.920
with their feet. So, he instead gets on all four&nbsp;
and crosses the room. Lastly, Reynie thinks for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:57.200
a long time and simply walks to the other end&nbsp;
of the room. When asked how he passed the test,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.080
he claims that the boxes had longer lengths,&nbsp;
which means that they weren’t squares. Since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:07.200
the question asked them not to step on the&nbsp;
squares, he simply walked across and passed. 
&nbsp;

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:11.600
After that, Milligan asks them to come with&nbsp;
him to the place where their final test&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:17.200
will be taken. He takes them to a sewer, claiming&nbsp;
that it is the pathway to reach their destination.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:22.320
The kids find it odd that the entrance examination&nbsp;
to such a prestigious school makes the finalists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:27.120
walk through sewage. Reynie also notes that none&nbsp;
of the examiners have mentioned the Boatwright&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:32.560
Academy yet. He still trusts Milligan and&nbsp;
follows him to reach the front lawn of a mansion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:37.360
Milligan leaves them alone for a few minutes&nbsp;
to check if everything is prepared inside. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.320
the kids are left to themselves, Dewey starts to&nbsp;
exercise while the other three talk about their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:47.360
families. Kate reveals that her mother died when&nbsp;
she was a little girl and her father abandoned her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:52.720
in an orphanage. She doesn’t blame him because&nbsp;
that is how she found her love for circuses. 
&nbsp;

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:58.640
Reynie also reveals that he never knew his parents&nbsp;
but he still misses them generally. Dewey follows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:05.680
up with a comment saying that his parents love&nbsp;
him and call him their miracle. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:10.800
they are called inside the mansion that looks&nbsp;
like a maze. Rhonda appears in front of them and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:16.160
reveals that she was sent to test them. For their&nbsp;
next task, they are kept in four different parts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:21.360
of the maze and are asked to find a way to reach&nbsp;
the second floor. Once they have climbed to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:27.040
said floor, the first three to ring the bell will&nbsp;
pass. As a hint, Rhonda mentions that they should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:33.040
be able to do this with their eyes closed. The&nbsp;
task finally starts and Reynie immediately begins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:38.400
looking for clues. He sees that each doorway has&nbsp;
four signs that point in different directions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:43.520
Meanwhile, Sticky takes the clue seriously and&nbsp;
tries to solve the maze with his eyes closed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:47.600
Because of his photographic memory, he&nbsp;
navigates the way pretty quickly. 
&nbsp;

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:52.400
Kate, on the other hand, thinks out of the box.&nbsp;
She opens a vent on the wall and uses it to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:57.600
climb up. At last, there is Dewey who follows&nbsp;
Sticky around. When he reaches the stairs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:02.240
Dewey pushes him to the wall and rings the&nbsp;
bell before everyone. Reynie soon finds out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:07.360
that the signs are in braille which tell him the&nbsp;
direction. He also reaches the stairs and helps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:12.560
Sticky up. Kate is already there and is waiting&nbsp;
for them so they can all ring the bell together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:17.360
As they do, the three win, and Dewey&nbsp;
is disqualified. In the instruction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:22.720
it was said that “the first three to ring the bell&nbsp;
will win” because Sticky, Kate, and Reynie were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:27.200
the three who rang it together, they won. 
Following that, they are introduced to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:32.560
mastermind of the test Mr. Nicholas Benedict.&nbsp;
As they talk about further orientation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:38.240
the fourth and youngest member named Constance&nbsp;
joins their team. She is a small, intelligent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:43.120
and witty girl who doesn’t care about what anyone&nbsp;
thinks. It turns out that she passed the test&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:47.760
a bit differently than the others. First, she&nbsp;
crossed all the questions, claiming that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:52.560
were wrong, then, she disobeyed the instructions&nbsp;
and brought as many pencils as she wanted,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:56.640
and in the last test, she enjoyed a&nbsp;
sandwich instead of solving the maze.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:03.120
Her unique personality still got her selected. 
Then, for the moment of truth, Mr. Benedict tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:07.440
them that they haven’t been recruited for&nbsp;
Boatwright Academy’s scholarship, instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.320
they have been selected for an undercover&nbsp;
mission to save the world. The children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.200
can hardly comprehend what is going on. 
Mr. Benedict explains that they are the only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:22.800
ones who can end “the emergency” and save the&nbsp;
world from chaos. It turns out that a mysterious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:28.480
subliminal message is being broadcasted all&nbsp;
around the globe through radios and televisions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:33.840
When people listen to such TV and radio shows,&nbsp;
they only hear the sound that has the highest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:40.320
frequency. But behind that sound, someone has&nbsp;
added violent messages in low frequency that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:46.560
the human ear cannot catch. Although people cannot&nbsp;
hear the message, their brain reacts to frequency.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:52.000
Hence, they subconsciously start to believe the&nbsp;
message which makes them anxious. These messages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.720
have created the illusion of international&nbsp;
panic that we call "The Emergency". 
&nbsp;

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:02.000
After a year long research, Mr. Benedict has found&nbsp;
out that the signals of the messages are coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:08.080
from an island that is the home to a children’s&nbsp;
school. Hence, only kids are allowed to go there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:13.040
Therefore, their group has been selected for&nbsp;
the task. He gives them the option to say no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:18.640
and is happy that he got to meet such intelligent&nbsp;
kids. After much thinking, all of them agree to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:23.680
join the mission and start their training. 
